0..71 Comment "// A model built on another: `include EqInteger` in a model of a theory"
72..148 Comment "// that includes `Eq` takes `EqInteger`\'s members as the model\'s own, so the"
149..227 Comment "// model\'s reduct at `Eq` is `EqInteger` itself. `==` at the integers then has"
228..303 Comment "// two modules answering its `Eq` slot, and they are one elaboration: their"
304..379 Comment "// components convert, so the slot resolves (uniqueness, up to conversion)."
380..382 Comment "//"
383..398 Comment "// - see: #2333"
399..457 Comment "// - see: #739 — a slot\'s answer unique up to conversion"
